OL,3,AAt least 15 killed in Kyiv as Ukraine
OL,4,Agrapples with air defence shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 15 people have been killed in
OL,7,Fthe latest Russian strikes targeting
OL,8,Fthe Ukrainian capital, Kyiv's mayor
OL,9,Fsaid, as Ukraine continues to face a
OL,10,Fshortage of air defence missiles.
OL,12,FBlocks of flats and warehouses were
OL,13,Fstruck across the city overnight, the
OL,14,FState Emergency Service of Ukraine
OL,15,Fsaid, while a children's hospital and
OL,16,Fschool were also damaged.
OL,18,FSpeaking to BBC News at a wrecked
OL,19,Fapartment block in Kyiv, Mayor Vitali
OL,20,FKlitschko said Ukraine needed
OL,21,F"ammunition, anti-missile systems - we
OL,22,Fneed support from our partners".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
